            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 30 year old female presented with recurrent leg ulcers of 3 year duration. History revealed that she also suffers from pain and stiffness in the small joints and feet for the past 4 years. Rheumatoid factor was strongly positive in the serum. Association of the two is interesting.</AbstractText>
